# Phase

Fundamental phase skeleton for all the processes in a family.

Not every process will use every phase, but all processes use phases that are shared across the family.

◇

attributes:
    - key: num
      name: Num
      details: Order of this phase within the family, same order across all processes.
      rules: "[1 .. unconstrained] at 1 unit"
      type_spec: Nat
    - key: name
      name: Name
      details: Unique among phases of the same family, same name across all processes.
      rules: unconstrained
      type_spec: STRING
    - key: description
      name: Description
      details: A high level description of this phase.
      rules: unconstrained
      nullable: true
      type_spec: STRING

